    <section id="involvement-paths" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">Ways to contribute</span><h2 class="mt-2 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary sm:text-4xl">There’s a place for your experience, resources, and energy.</h2><p class="mt-3 text-on-surface-variant">Choose how you want to strengthen the ecosystem and help grassroots entrepreneurs build sustainable businesses.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <a href="/get-involved#mentor" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Volunteer as Mentor</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Share hard-won business wisdom through masterclasses, regional clinics, and advisory sessions.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex font-bold text-secondary group-hover:underline">Become a Mentor →</span></a>
        <a href="/get-involved#partners" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">handshake</span></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Join as Partner</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Connect your products, expertise, and networks to a verified nationwide MSME community.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Partner With FLAME →</span></a>
        <a href="/get-involved#sponsors" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-tertiary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">campaign</span></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Sponsor an Event</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Support expos, summits, and practical workshops that bring MSMEs and institutional partners together.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex font-bold text-tertiary-container group-hover:underline">Explore Sponsorship →</span></a>
        <a href="/get-involved#community" class="group rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"><span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-surface-container text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">volunteer_activism</span></span><h3 class="mt-5 font-headline text-xl font-bold">Sponsor a Community</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">Help local chapters deliver learning, connection, and opportunity to entrepreneurs where they live.</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex font-bold text-primary group-hover:underline">Support a Chapter →</span></a>
    </div></section>
    <section id="mentor" class="bg-white px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary">Pay it forward • Bayanihan</span><h2 class="mt-5 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary sm:text-4xl">Mentor the next generation of negosyantes.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-on-surface-variant">Help turn grassroots families into lasting stability through practical advice, masterclasses, and one-on-one guidance.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-on-surface-variant"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">check_circle</span>Featured speaker opportunities at provincial summits</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">check_circle</span>FLAME PH certified mentor accreditation</li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">check_circle</span>High-impact social contribution recognized nationwide</li></ul><a class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-full bg-secondary px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white hover:bg-secondary-container" href="/membership#registration">Apply to Mentor →</a></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-8"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Mentorship opportunities</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-headline text-2xl font-bold">MSME Clinic Hours</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Join weekend virtual or local roundtable clinics and give business owners clear next steps they can act on immediately.</p></div></div></div></section>
    <section id="partners" class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-5 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 md:grid-cols-2 lg:px-8"><div id="sponsors" class="rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-8"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Banks, logistics, telcos &amp; FMCGs</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary">Channel products to MSME decision makers.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Co-create financial products, sponsor nationwide events, and embed useful solutions directly inside the FLAME PH community.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex font-bold text-primary hover:underline" href="/about#partners">Discuss a Partnership →</a></div><div id="community" class="rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-white"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary-fixed">Regional ecosystem champions</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold">Build stronger communities, one chapter at a time.</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-white/80">Support local meetups, practical training, and community aid so entrepreneurs can access opportunity wherever they are.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex font-bold text-white underline" href="/about#contact">Support Community Aid →</a></div></section>
    <section id="contributors" class="bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-center"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Multi-disciplinary synergy</span><h2 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary sm:text-4xl">How Diverse Contributors Drive Collective Impact</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-on-surface-variant">From micro-contributions to enterprise sponsorships, every resource shared helps build an unshakeable commercial foundation across the archipelago.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><a href="/get-involved#mentor" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">school</span></span><h3 class="mt-4 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Time &amp; Expertise</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-on-surface-variant">Guest lectures, tax and accounting clinics, digital POS onboarding, and legal advisory sessions for underserved micro-traders.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-primary"><li>◉ Pro-bono bookkeeping clinics</li><li>◉ DTI &amp; BIR registration guides</li></ul></a><a href="/get-involved#community" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-tertiary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">volunteer_activism</span></span><h3 class="mt-4 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Funding &amp; Equipment</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-on-surface-variant">Machinery grants, cold-chain space pledges, logistics subsidies, and co-working hubs for cooperative ventures.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-tertiary-container"><li>◉ Vacuum sealers &amp; solar dryers</li><li>◉ Last-mile freight credit pools</li></ul></a><a href="/get-involved#partners" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-100 text-secondary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">storefront</span></span><h3 class="mt-4 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Market Access &amp; Introductions</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-on-surface-variant">Retail shelf allocations in major department stores, institutional corporate procurement contracts, and export corridors.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-secondary"><li>◉ Institutional supplier inclusion</li><li>◉ Cross-border marketplace tips</li></ul></a><a href="/get-involved#community" class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">flag</span></span><h3 class="mt-4 font-headline text-lg font-bold">Local Chapter Leadership</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-5 text-on-surface-variant">Founding municipal chapters, organizing offline bayanihan meetups in your hometown, and mobilizing regional MSME councils.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-primary"><li>◉ Barangay business circles</li><li>◉ LGU public-private advocacy</li></ul></a></div></div></section>
    <section id="partnership-intake" class="bg-white px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="max-w-3xl"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Partnership intake</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary sm:text-4xl">I want to help with…</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Tell us how you would like to partner with the FLAME PH nationwide ecosystem. Our partnerships desk will review your details and respond within 48 business hours.</p></div><div class="mt-8 rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low p-5 sm:p-8"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-primary">Select your interest areas <span class="font-normal text-on-surface-variant">(Pick all that apply)</span></p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="/get-involved#mentor" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Mentoring &amp; Coaching</a><a href="/get-involved#partners" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Training &amp; Workshops</a><a href="/get-involved#sponsors" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Corporate / Event Sponsorship</a><a href="/get-involved#community" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Community / Cluster Adoption</a><a href="/events" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">MSME Market Opportunities</a><a href="/about#partners" class="rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary shadow-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10 hover:bg-primary hover:text-white">Technology &amp; AI Copilot Tooling</a></div><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="text-xs font-bold text-primary">Full Name *<input class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border-0 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10" placeholder="e.g. Maria Clara Santos"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold text-primary">Professional Title / Organization *<input class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border-0 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10" placeholder="e.g. VP Commercial, Metro Retail Co."></label><label class="text-xs font-bold text-primary">Work or Business Email *<input type="email" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border-0 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10" placeholder="maria@organization.ph"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold text-primary">Mobile / Viber Number *<input class="mt-2 w-full rounded-xl border-0 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10" placeholder="+63 9XX XXX XXXX"></label><label class="text-xs font-bold text-primary sm:col-span-2">How would you like to contribute? *<textarea class="mt-2 min-h-28 w-full rounded-xl border-0 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm ring-1 ring-primary/10" placeholder="Describe your proposed support, professional background, equipment or program pledge, or ideas on how we can collaborate."></textarea></label></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">◉ Zero spam. Reviewed directly by the FLAME PH Executive Secretariat.</p><a href="/about#contact" class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-secondary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-secondary-container">Submit Involvement Intent →</a></div></div></div></section>
    <section id="awards" class="bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-14 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">Recognition &amp; visibility</span><h2 class="mt-3 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary sm:text-4xl">Know an MSME that deserves to be recognized?</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-on-surface-variant">Nominate a resilient, innovative, community-building, or women-led enterprise for FLAME PH recognition and nationwide visibility.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-full bg-secondary px-7 py-4 font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-secondary-container" href="/events#awards">Nominate an MSME Awardee →</a></div></section>
    <section class="bg-surface-container-low px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-primary/5 p-5 ring-1 ring-primary/5 sm:p-6"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-200 text-tertiary-container"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">info</span></span><div><h2 class="font-headline text-base font-bold text-primary sm:text-lg">Mahalagang Paalala tungkol sa Pakikipagtulungan at Livelihood Programs:</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-on-surface-variant sm:text-sm">All community partnerships, seed equipment allocations, and livelihood opportunities are vetted by the FLAME PH Secretariat to protect community integrity. Programs depend on partner availability, geographic capacity, local chapter readiness, and verified compliance with non-profit standards. FLAME PH operates transparently under strict governance and does not charge fee-for-service registration to volunteer mentors.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="bg-primary px-4 py-14 text-center text-white sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed px-4 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface">Bayanihan para sa negosyong Pilipino</span><h2 class="mt-4 font-headline text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Ready to make a lasting mark on the nation's MSME backbone?</h2><p class="mt-3 font-semibold text-white/85">Hindi mo kailangang mag-isa. Sama-sama tayong bumuo ng matatag na Pilipinas.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-secondary-container" href="#involvement-paths"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 text-lg">handshake</span>Get Involved Today</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white px-6 py-3 font-bold text-primary shadow-sm hover:bg-surface-container" href="/membership#registration"><span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2 text-lg">person_add</span>Join FLAME PH Free →</a></div></div></section>
